%% Mermaid flowchart for service workflow

flowchart TD
  A[User / Client] -->|POST /login| B[FastAPI /login]
  B -->|initiate_auth| C[Cognito: InitiateAuth]
  C -->|AuthenticationResult| B
  B -->|set cookie id_token| A

  A -->|POST /create-user| D[FastAPI /create-user]
  D -->|check headers| E{Has Authorization header?}
  E -- yes --> F[Verify token via JWKS]
  E -- no --> G{Has id_token cookie?}
  G -- yes --> F
  G -- no --> H[Return 401: please sign-in]

  F -->|roles/admin?| I{Is admin?}
  I -- yes --> J[auth.admin_create_user -> Cognito admin_create_user]
  I -- no --> K[Return 403 Forbidden]

  J --> L[Cognito: admin_create_user]
  L --> M[Return success to client]

  style B fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
  style D fill:#bbf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
  style L fill:#bfb,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
